-- No STOP row. captured: bug-logs/mxcli-bugs.md BUG-86, still open on v0.21.0.
-- key: `currentDeviceType()` in a CREATE NANOFLOW still passes `check`/`exec`
-- evidence: native mxbuild still fails `[CE0117]` at the Create-variable activity
create or modify nanoflow Module.NF_Device_Get ()
returns String
begin
  declare $Device String = toString(currentDeviceType());
  return $Device;
end;
